A license notice at the top of a data file is never its header, and it is not a comment of the first key either, though comment lines directly above a key start its line range: `name` starts at its own line.
== args
input/config.yaml
== file input/config.yaml
# Copyright 2024 Acme
name: x
# The version.
version: 1
== stdout
input/config.yaml (4 lines)
[L2-L2] name: x
[L3-L4] version: 1
== stderr
== exit 0
